name=Truck Repaint
id=TruckRepaint
require=\87fordB700
description=Repaint KI5's '87 Ford B700/F700 trucks into their plain factory colors with a paintbrush and vanilla paint buckets. <LINE> <LINE> 
description=<H2> How it works <LINE> <TEXT> 
description=Carry a paintbrush and paint buckets. Right-click a supported truck, choose Repaint Truck, then a color. A solid color uses one full bucket. A two-tone job uses half a bucket of each. <LINE> <LINE> 
description=<H2> Colors <LINE> <TEXT> 
description=- F700 box, bank and SWAT trucks: plain factory colors <LINE> 
description=- B700 military, school and prison buses: Redneck Camo <LINE> 
description=- Oshkosh P19A military and fire trucks, if KI5's '86 Oshkosh P19A is enabled <LINE> <LINE> 
description=Paint covers a livery but never creates one. Safe to add or remove. Works in multiplayer.
